an class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club},\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Club},\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SquareThread}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SquareThread}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}square\\text{-}thread}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(T,C,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Club}(T,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(C,\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\},\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(T\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\to C(\\alpha)=T\\cap\\alpha\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}square\\text{-}thread}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(T,C,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Club}(T,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(C,\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\},\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(T\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\to C(\\alpha)=T\\cap\\alpha\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}square\\text{-}thread} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SquareThread}_S(D,C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(D,C,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}square\\text{-}thread} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8SquareThread}_S(D,C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(D,C,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A thread is a club agreeing with the square sequence at every accumulation point.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-square-thread</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6c8f804f98505ae8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,D,C,\\kappa \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club},\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCom